@host = http://localhost:3000/api
# Log in first (see auth.http) and paste the token here
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
# Ids from GET /accounts, GET /credit-cards, GET /categories
@accountId = PASTE_ACCOUNT_ID
@cardId = PASTE_CARD_ID
@categoryId = PASTE_EXPENSE_CATEGORY_ID
@subscriptionId = PASTE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID

### Monthly subscription paid from an account (amountCents = 15.00)
POST {{host}}/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Netflix", "amountCents": 1500, "frequency": "monthly", "nextDate": "2026-08-05",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}" }

### Weekly subscription paid with a credit card
POST {{host}}/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Gimnasio", "amountCents": 500, "frequency": "weekly", "nextDate": "2026-10-25",
  "creditCardId": "{{cardId}}", "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}" }

### Yearly subscription (frequencies: weekly, monthly, quarterly, semiannual, yearly)
POST {{host}}/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Dominio", "amountCents": 1800, "frequency": "yearly", "nextDate": "2027-01-31",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}" }

### List subscriptions
GET {{host}}/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One subscription (shows lastError if the last charge failed)
GET {{host}}/subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Charge everything that is due now (the daily job does this for everyone at 00:05 UTC)
POST {{host}}/subscriptions/process-due
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upcoming charges, next 30 days (overdue = true when not charged yet)
GET {{host}}/subscriptions/upcoming?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Generated charges are normal expenses
GET {{host}}/transactions?type=expense
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Edit (changing nextDate also changes the day of the month it is charged on)
PATCH {{host}}/subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amountCents": 2200 }

### Pause (204)
DELETE {{host}}/subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reactivate (a past nextDate jumps to the next one from today; the pause is not charged)
PATCH {{host}}/subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "active": true }

### Switch the payer from account to card (null clears the other one)
PATCH {{host}}/subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountId": null, "creditCardId": "{{cardId}}" }

### Account and card together (expects 400)
POST {{host}}/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mala", "amountCents": 100, "frequency": "monthly", "nextDate": "2026-12-01",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "creditCardId": "{{cardId}}", "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}" }

### Unknown frequency (expects 400)
POST {{host}}/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mala", "amountCents": 100, "frequency": "daily", "nextDate": "2026-12-01",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}" }

### days out of range (expects 400)
GET {{host}}/subscriptions/upcoming?days=366
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
